\end{enumerate}
Vanishing of Brauer groups is assumed for **every finite extension $K'/K$**, not merely $K$ itself; first conclusion includes all $q\ge1$ for $K^{sep,\times}$, second all torsion $G_K$-modules at $q\ge2$.

